-- MAGIC %md
-- MAGIC ### Execution control flow
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Databricks Lakeflow jobs provides constructs for controlling execution of tasks. One such construct is the classic *if/else* construct, allowing tasks to be executed conditionally.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This is exemplified in the **run_customermgmt_YES_NO** task. Conditional on the expression laid out in the **Condition** field, this task will trigger a *True* or *False* output condition, which is declared in the **Depends on** field of downstream tasks.

