-- MAGIC ## Status Reporting
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC You can send notifications to report job or task outcome to one or more email addresses, or third-party destinations such as Slack, Microsoft Teams, PagerDuty, or any webhook-based service. 
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Notifications can be sent based on any of the following events:
